title: "Subtype selectivity of analgesic targets in human dorsal root ganglia"
abstract: "Code and derived data for a genome-wide benchmark of analgesic targets across four human DRG cohorts, one mouse cohort, six FinnGen endpoints and one public proteome. Places ADORA1, CNR1, OPRK1, TRPV1, P2RX3 and Nav1.7/1.8/1.9 on a common ΔAUC yardstick."
